nd to the test. As each of the guys secretly desires Fred for himself, she yearns to be accepted into the group and be considered 'one of them', but is asked to sacrifice more and more in order to belong."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8kGEfpIabMiaWpdMkTcNFclld5W.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2stEL3ibnjg9B9Rjr0U4CyuYc5Z.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1442922,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8kGEfpIabMiaWpdMkTcNFclld5W.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8kGEfpIabMiaWpdMkTcNFclld5W.jpg","language":"it","width":900,"height":1350},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8kGEfpIabMiaWpdMkTcNFclld5W.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8kGEfpIabMiaWpdMkTcNFclld5W.jpg","language":"it","width":900,"height":1350},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p1Fd8cIp0rfqfmlb66ydZADsJP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p1Fd8cIp0rfqfmlb66ydZADsJP.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b52sxXzCxb8oanJtnUaPzqiRryh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b52sxXzCxb8oanJtnUaPzqiRryh.jpg","language":"it","width":771,"height":1157},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3xQTqrWE4nLJhrfc4jPU4t0yBmd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3xQTqrWE4nLJhrfc4jPU4t0yBmd.jpg","language":"it","width":853,"height":1280},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yYnETszIyTjrPRMiq3rWIDvlhko.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yYnETszIyTjrPRMiq3rWIDvlhko.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://imag